{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43410","headline":"天竺国胡僧水晶念珠 · 无名氏","name":"天竺国胡僧水晶念珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天竺胡僧踏云立，红精素贯鲛人泣。\n细影疑随焰火销，圆光恐滴袈裟湿。\n夜梵西天千佛声，指轮次第驱寒星。\n若非叶下滴秋露，则是井底圆春冰。\n凄清妙丽应难并，眼界真如意珠静。\n碧莲花下独提携，坚洁何如幻泡影。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}